1
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:17,726
- This is Ranma...
- Hi.

2
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:19,811
...of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

3
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:23,148
- This is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.
- Uh... Eh? What? Huh?

4
00:00:23,773 --> 00:00:26,651
These two were put into
an arranged betrothal by their parents.

5
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:28,278
You don't get a say in what I do.

6
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:33,408
But Ranma has a bit of a problem.

7
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,496
- Whenever he's splashed with cold water...
- Ah!

8
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,665
...he transforms into a girl.

9
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:50,550
RANMA1/2

10
00:02:12,715 --> 00:02:17,345
DARLING CHARLOTTE

11
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:22,058
There!

12
00:02:23,768 --> 00:02:25,854
Akane,
can we take a little break?

13
00:02:25,937 --> 00:02:28,106
We were wanting to get
something warm to eat.

14
00:02:28,189 --> 00:02:29,065
Okay.

15
00:02:34,279 --> 00:02:35,613
There's a skating club?

16
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:37,282
Yeah, you should join.

17
00:02:37,365 --> 00:02:39,868
I'm sure they'll be happy to make you
a full member right away.

18
00:02:39,951 --> 00:02:42,120
I'm still trying to figure out
what I want to do.

19
00:02:42,203 --> 00:02:44,581
A lot of people have been asking me
to help with their club.

20
00:02:45,748 --> 00:02:47,041
Huh?

21
00:02:47,125 --> 00:02:48,877
- Hmm? Oh, no.
- Huh?

22
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,879
I think I might have left P-chan
on the ice.

23
00:02:51,754 --> 00:02:53,047
What is a P-chan?

24
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:55,049
Is that her little black pig?

25
00:03:02,473 --> 00:03:03,558
Charlotte.

26
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:11,858
You're a Charlotte.
I'm totally taking you home with me.

27
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,946
Mm-hmm. Come on, Charlotte.

28
00:03:20,074 --> 00:03:21,492
You're so cute!

29
00:03:27,582 --> 00:03:30,126
Okay, break it down for me again.

30
00:03:31,753 --> 00:03:33,504
Why do you think I'm related to this girl?

31
00:03:33,588 --> 00:03:35,423
Don't play dumb with us, Ranma.

32
00:03:35,506 --> 00:03:37,258
You really expect us
to believe you're not?

33
00:03:40,053 --> 00:03:42,430
She introduced herself
with the name Ranma Saotome.

34
00:03:42,513 --> 00:03:44,098
And she has the same pigtail as you.

35
00:03:44,182 --> 00:03:46,643
- And she's a strong martial artist.
- I bet she's your cousin or sister.

36
00:03:46,726 --> 00:03:49,103
Whoever she is,
you need to introduce us!

37
00:03:50,521 --> 00:03:52,649
Hmm. Don't know her, but...

38
00:03:52,732 --> 00:03:54,442
...sounds pretty dumb.

39
00:03:54,525 --> 00:03:56,069
Hey! Are you running away from us?

40
00:03:56,152 --> 00:03:59,197
And all of this
after having the nerve to deflower Akane?

41
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,406
I did what to who now?

42
00:04:00,490 --> 00:04:03,534
Please! Will you at least
let us have dibs on this one?

43
00:04:03,618 --> 00:04:05,411
You shouldn't be hogging the fun
to yourself!

44
00:04:05,495 --> 00:04:10,208
Why do you idiots keep insisting that
I want an unsexy little tomboy like Akane?

45
00:04:10,291 --> 00:04:11,542
- Ranma!
- Huh?

46
00:04:11,626 --> 00:04:15,296
Huh? Whoa, w-what are you doing?
You wanna fight?

47
00:04:21,094 --> 00:04:23,012
Come on.
You don't have to start crying, you know?

48
00:04:23,096 --> 00:04:24,764
And besides, it doesn't matter...

49
00:04:24,847 --> 00:04:27,433
...how unsexy you are,
'cause it's not like, uh...

50
00:04:28,351 --> 00:04:29,852
P-chan is missing!

51
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:32,522
It's not like I really care...

52
00:04:34,816 --> 00:04:35,817
Hmm?

53
00:04:38,736 --> 00:04:41,447
P-chan disappeared
from the skating rink earlier.

54
00:04:41,531 --> 00:04:44,325
He was kidnapped!
There are people who witnessed it.

55
00:04:45,952 --> 00:04:47,120
Hey, welcome!

56
00:04:47,203 --> 00:04:49,122
I wish I could help you, but...

57
00:04:49,205 --> 00:04:50,873
Hmm?

58
00:04:50,957 --> 00:04:52,750
Remind me what this pig looked like again.

59
00:04:52,834 --> 00:04:54,669
Could you be serious for once?

60
00:04:54,752 --> 00:04:56,671
I mean, what am I seeing over there?

61
00:04:58,881 --> 00:05:01,134
It's P-chan!

62
00:05:03,928 --> 00:05:05,888
Back off! What do you think you're doing?

63
00:05:05,972 --> 00:05:08,099
You leave me
and my piggy, Charlotte, alone.

64
00:05:08,182 --> 00:05:10,143
Say what? I'm positive that's my P-chan.

65
00:05:10,226 --> 00:05:12,270
And if I say that it's Charlotte,
then it's Charlotte.

66
00:05:12,353 --> 00:05:13,438
CHARLOTTE - P-CHAN

67
00:05:16,524 --> 00:05:19,193
- No, that's mine.
- Hey, welcome!

68
00:05:19,277 --> 00:05:22,155
- I want it. Give it back.
- Hmm?

69
00:05:22,238 --> 00:05:24,741
- This yours?
- Yes, he is.

70
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:26,451
Oh!

71
00:05:29,495 --> 00:05:31,289
I hope you forgive my partner.

72
00:05:31,372 --> 00:05:33,249
Wow, oh, wow, that guy's really hot.

73
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:34,917
No harm done. Thank you.

74
00:05:35,001 --> 00:05:35,918
You're such a big...

75
00:05:36,002 --> 00:05:39,589
She tends to have a habit of taking
cute things that don't belong to her.

76
00:05:39,672 --> 00:05:41,382
Once she gets locked in on something,

77
00:05:41,466 --> 00:05:43,593
it'll often go home with her
right on the spot.

78
00:05:43,676 --> 00:05:45,595
Dude, isn't that, like, a crime?

79
00:05:45,678 --> 00:05:48,598
Give me!

80
00:05:48,681 --> 00:05:50,475
Gimme! Give me!

81
00:05:50,558 --> 00:05:54,145
Would you stop doing that,
you stupid girl!

82
00:05:54,228 --> 00:05:56,856
Oh, no. You're, like, so mean.

83
00:05:59,275 --> 00:06:01,069
Hmm?

84
00:06:03,112 --> 00:06:05,031
I really wanna face off with you.

85
00:06:05,114 --> 00:06:07,158
So, what? Are you saying you want a fight?

86
00:06:07,241 --> 00:06:08,618
Please! I'm not an animal.

87
00:06:08,701 --> 00:06:10,286
We'll face off in pair skating.

88
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:11,412
You want to skate?

89
00:06:11,496 --> 00:06:15,291
Yes, and if I win, I'm totally demanding
that you give back Charlotte.

90
00:06:15,375 --> 00:06:17,919
- Now I remember.
- Hmm?

91
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:21,005
I know them. I kept thinking
they looked familiar.

92
00:06:22,006 --> 00:06:26,344
Those two are the golden pair of Freestyle
Skating from Kolkhoz High School.

93
00:06:26,928 --> 00:06:29,055
I'm Azusa Shiratori. Hi.

94
00:06:29,138 --> 00:06:31,265
Huh. I'm Mikado Sanzenin.

95
00:06:31,849 --> 00:06:33,518
Are you gonna
place an order or not?

96
00:06:33,601 --> 00:06:36,979
Akane, you don't want to be
in a skating match against them.

97
00:06:37,063 --> 00:06:38,981
Their skills are
way beyond ordinary students'.

98
00:06:39,065 --> 00:06:40,983
You know I don't care about that.

99
00:06:41,067 --> 00:06:44,362
If you're a smart girl,
you'll surrender while you still can.

100
00:06:44,445 --> 00:06:46,739
I knew
that whole innocent thing was an act.

101
00:06:46,823 --> 00:06:50,076
Wait for me, Charlotte. I'll be getting
your room ready in the meantime.

102
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:52,120
Don't worry about her, P-chan.

103
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:54,414
I promise I'm not gonna lose.

104
00:06:55,415 --> 00:06:56,833
Sounds pretty dumb.

105
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,709
Miss, I'm sorry.

106
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:01,838
- My partner gets herself in trouble.
- Huh?

107
00:07:02,797 --> 00:07:04,757
I can make it up to you, easily.

108
00:07:04,841 --> 00:07:05,842
Huh?

109
00:07:21,899 --> 00:07:23,651
Ranma, you...

110
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:29,365
It's an unorthodox white glove,
but I'll accept your challenge.

111
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:31,367
We'll face off in one week.

112
00:07:31,451 --> 00:07:33,744
Kolkhoz High School will serve
as the venue.

113
00:07:33,828 --> 00:07:36,456
Aw! I can't believe how cute that is!

114
00:07:36,539 --> 00:07:37,665
I want it! Give it!

115
00:07:37,748 --> 00:07:40,626
- The challenge will be pair skating. Deal?
- Give it to me!

116
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:44,338
- Yeah, whatever.
- Give me François!

117
00:07:44,422 --> 00:07:46,257
François! Give it to me!

118
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,341
Give me François!

119
00:07:47,425 --> 00:07:53,014
You are absolutely ruining all of
my dramatic tension, you idiotic girl!

120
00:07:53,097 --> 00:07:54,432
This is mine now. Yay.

121
00:07:54,515 --> 00:07:56,350
When the hell you gonna order something?

122
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:59,187
- Why do you have to be like this?
- Let's go home.

123
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:00,813
- Can't you be normal for once?
- François.

124
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:11,282
Let me make something clear.

125
00:08:11,824 --> 00:08:13,826
That wasn't me getting jealous back there.

126
00:08:15,036 --> 00:08:18,164
I'm just not a fan of those player-types
getting away with that kinda crap.

127
00:08:18,789 --> 00:08:20,833
Well, it was still unnecessary.

128
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:23,461
You know what?

129
00:08:23,544 --> 00:08:25,171
You should thank me for helping you out...

130
00:08:25,254 --> 00:08:26,088
Oh.

131
00:08:28,925 --> 00:08:30,301
Hmm. Hang on.

132
00:08:30,384 --> 00:08:32,220
Do you like that kinda guy?

133
00:08:34,722 --> 00:08:35,890
You're so dumb.

134
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:39,727
If that fish cake were
a fraction of a second slower,

135
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:42,271
I think you probably would have seen
me crack his chin open.

136
00:08:43,731 --> 00:08:46,275
If you weren't unsexy before,
you are now.

137
00:08:46,817 --> 00:08:50,071
Maybe I'll bother with all that
stuff when I find someone worth liking.

138
00:08:51,572 --> 00:08:55,368
You're having a pair skate
showdown and P-chan is the prize?

139
00:08:55,451 --> 00:08:57,328
So, are you two gonna pair up?

140
00:08:57,411 --> 00:08:59,956
You know that means
you'll have to be all synced-up, right?

141
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:03,209
In your own way, I suppose
you two are always in harmony.

142
00:09:03,292 --> 00:09:04,627
You really think so?

143
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,630
I gotta tell you, I don't really care...

144
00:09:07,713 --> 00:09:09,131
...what happens to the pig.

145
00:09:09,215 --> 00:09:11,050
Allow me to be the one to take the ice.

146
00:09:11,634 --> 00:09:14,095
Akane, I'd be honored to skate with you.

147
00:09:14,178 --> 00:09:17,682
I'm curious. Did somebody already tell you
about the skating match, Charlotte?

148
00:09:17,765 --> 00:09:19,600
Who do you think
you're calling Charlotte?

149
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:22,979
Regardless of how good you are at this,
I was the one who issued the challenge.

150
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:25,648
Then maybe now's the time
for our own skating battle.

151
00:09:25,731 --> 00:09:26,899
All right!

152
00:09:28,025 --> 00:09:31,404
Instead of that, maybe we should try
practicing how to stand first?

153
00:09:34,115 --> 00:09:35,324
Look at you.

154
00:09:35,408 --> 00:09:36,993
What's with the posture?

155
00:09:37,076 --> 00:09:38,286
Shut your face!

156
00:09:38,369 --> 00:09:42,039
How are you supposed to participate in a
skating competition when you can't skate?

157
00:09:42,123 --> 00:09:43,833
It's not like I had a choice.

158
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:46,919
All right, get a grip.
I thought you were a man.

159
00:09:47,753 --> 00:09:50,006
Yeah, but right now, I'm a girl.

160
00:09:50,089 --> 00:09:53,134
Why go through the hassle
of splashing yourself with cold water

161
00:09:53,217 --> 00:09:54,385
before coming out here?

162
00:09:54,468 --> 00:09:58,264
Yeah, I mean, it's not very cool
if a man doesn't know how to skate.

163
00:09:58,848 --> 00:10:01,976
I doubt the uncoolness factor has
much to do with being a boy or a girl.

164
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,894
Wait, where did P-chan go?

165
00:10:06,063 --> 00:10:08,608
Whoops, so sorry about that.

166
00:10:08,691 --> 00:10:09,900
Azusa Shiratori.

167
00:10:10,401 --> 00:10:12,028
I know you did that on purpose.

168
00:10:12,111 --> 00:10:15,656
I'd never! Also, it seems your partner is
giving you enough things to worry about.

169
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:16,574
Huh?

170
00:10:18,409 --> 00:10:21,203
Somebody help! Help me!
Please, somebody help!

171
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,709
Hello, there. Are you all right?

172
00:10:27,376 --> 00:10:29,754
Uh, you're that Mikado Sanzenin guy.

173
00:10:30,254 --> 00:10:33,132
Huh? Have we happened to meet before?

174
00:10:33,215 --> 00:10:34,216
How very odd.

175
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,968
Yes, I would be surprised.

176
00:10:36,052 --> 00:10:38,721
I don't believe I'd ever forget
a pretty face like yours.

177
00:10:41,182 --> 00:10:43,601
You can have fun picking up
all the girls you want later.

178
00:10:43,684 --> 00:10:45,645
It's time for the 100-man kumite now.

179
00:10:45,728 --> 00:10:50,024
You're doing that? Really?
Is that part of your training routine?

180
00:10:55,112 --> 00:10:56,656
Huh?

181
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,828
You ladies should step back for a bit.

182
00:11:02,912 --> 00:11:04,455
I would never want for you to get hurt.

183
00:11:10,044 --> 00:11:10,961
Come at us.

184
00:11:12,171 --> 00:11:15,675
Let the hundred-man kumite begin!

185
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:45,788
Wow! Look at them go.

186
00:12:04,849 --> 00:12:06,225
We're finished now.

187
00:12:06,308 --> 00:12:07,935
In nine seconds flat.

188
00:12:08,602 --> 00:12:13,232
They really are the golden pair
of the Freestyle Skating Martial Team.

189
00:12:14,734 --> 00:12:16,110
The Martial Team, huh?

190
00:12:16,694 --> 00:12:20,030
T-That means we'll be using
martial skating to face off!

191
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:23,909
I can win. I can win anything
that has the name "martial" in it!

192
00:12:23,993 --> 00:12:27,705
Of course you can. But I'm pretty sure
you need to learn how to skate first.

193
00:12:27,788 --> 00:12:29,290
- Look. There's a pig!
- Aw!

194
00:12:29,373 --> 00:12:31,041
Hang on, little guy.

195
00:12:32,209 --> 00:12:33,544
There's P-chan.

196
00:12:33,627 --> 00:12:34,670
Hello, Charlotte!

197
00:12:34,754 --> 00:12:36,589
Hmph.

198
00:12:36,672 --> 00:12:38,507
Hey, Akane! Whoa!

199
00:12:38,591 --> 00:12:39,800
Here, P-chan.

200
00:12:47,057 --> 00:12:49,310
Let sweet Azusa spoil you
with a little present.

201
00:12:50,686 --> 00:12:53,189
That's just so cute!

202
00:12:53,272 --> 00:12:55,858
Geez. Ugh, you're horrible.

203
00:12:56,817 --> 00:12:58,194
Putting a collar on him.

204
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,111
CHARLOTTE

205
00:12:59,195 --> 00:13:00,529
What-what is this?

206
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,948
I'm taking this thing off you right now.

207
00:13:07,036 --> 00:13:08,412
That's not going to work.

208
00:13:08,996 --> 00:13:10,873
Unfortunately, I locked the clasp.

209
00:13:10,956 --> 00:13:12,583
So if you want me to take the collar off,

210
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,835
then you'll have to defeat me
in our showdown later.

211
00:13:15,419 --> 00:13:17,254
It's not gonna matter
how good the golden pair is

212
00:13:17,338 --> 00:13:18,923
because when Ranma and I
team up together--

213
00:13:19,006 --> 00:13:21,926
Get over here, stupid!
I-I'm falling over!

214
00:13:22,009 --> 00:13:24,887
I can't stand up anymore!
Hurry up and help me--

215
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:26,972
I'm happy to give you
private skating lessons.

216
00:13:27,056 --> 00:13:31,101
I didn't ask for your help.
Let go of me, prick!

217
00:13:31,185 --> 00:13:32,853
Well, I'm sorry to hear that.

218
00:13:33,437 --> 00:13:35,022
But if that's the case...

219
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:38,067
...let me take a parting gift
for saving you.

220
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,160
Ooh!

221
00:14:03,551 --> 00:14:04,635
Oh. Wait, Miss...

222
00:14:05,219 --> 00:14:06,470
Ranma...

223
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:08,055
What a pure heart she has,

224
00:14:08,722 --> 00:14:10,891
for her to sob so violently like that.

225
00:14:10,975 --> 00:14:13,352
I would cry too if it was you kissing me.

226
00:14:14,478 --> 00:14:15,646
PUBLIC BATH

227
00:14:24,029 --> 00:14:27,491
So gross. How dare that ass
put his hands on me like that?

228
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:30,995
And he did it in front of Akane,
of all people!

229
00:14:31,078 --> 00:14:32,955
Mmm...

230
00:14:33,581 --> 00:14:35,249
- I'll never forgive him!
- Whoa!

231
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:39,587
Ah! Just a tiny kiss
and she broke down with tears of joy.

232
00:14:40,087 --> 00:14:42,256
Lock me up for crimes of the heart.

233
00:14:42,339 --> 00:14:43,966
Sanzenin!

234
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:46,385
You and I are gonna fight right now.

235
00:14:46,886 --> 00:14:49,555
But don't think you have a chance
of surviving this.

236
00:14:49,638 --> 00:14:51,265
Uh... Ranma?

237
00:14:51,849 --> 00:14:53,225
Ah, the guy from earlier.

238
00:14:53,309 --> 00:14:55,060
You just show up
out of nowhere, don't you?

239
00:14:55,728 --> 00:14:57,187
I'm infuriated.

240
00:14:57,271 --> 00:15:00,524
This is the first time I've felt rage
like this in my life!

241
00:15:05,195 --> 00:15:07,615
I don't quite know what it is
that you're so angry about,

242
00:15:08,282 --> 00:15:11,869
but for inflicting damage to this
sacred space, your blood will spill here.

243
00:15:11,952 --> 00:15:14,121
I was thinking the same thing.

244
00:15:14,663 --> 00:15:17,249
For all the humiliation
you've put me through...

245
00:15:18,125 --> 00:15:20,836
...I'll make you pay!

246
00:15:25,049 --> 00:15:26,425
Oh, wow.

247
00:15:26,508 --> 00:15:28,093
His head just broke through the ice.

248
00:15:29,136 --> 00:15:30,220
How pathetic.

249
00:15:31,138 --> 00:15:33,057
I suppose that's the end of it for you.

250
00:15:44,526 --> 00:15:48,656
I was resistant to using this technique
when facing such an obvious amateur.

251
00:15:53,243 --> 00:15:55,120
Huh? I know that stance.

252
00:15:56,121 --> 00:15:59,583
That's his ultimate technique,
Dance of Death!

253
00:15:59,667 --> 00:16:02,378
Dance of Death? That doesn't sound good.

254
00:16:13,138 --> 00:16:16,517
This looks bad. No one has
ever escaped his spin attack before.

255
00:16:17,017 --> 00:16:21,689
Anyone caught in Sanzenin's vortex is left
writhing in agony, like they're dancing.

256
00:16:21,772 --> 00:16:27,152
I mean, literally,
this is the Dance of Death!

257
00:16:34,201 --> 00:16:35,786
Whoa. Perfection.

258
00:16:43,836 --> 00:16:45,254
Ranma, can you stand?

259
00:16:53,095 --> 00:16:54,096
Hang on.

260
00:16:54,179 --> 00:16:58,225
How's he still able to move around like
that after getting hit by that technique?

261
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,688
Shall we call it a draw?

262
00:17:03,355 --> 00:17:04,481
Ranma was the winner.

263
00:17:04,982 --> 00:17:06,025
Huh?

264
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:08,944
Hmm.

265
00:17:20,706 --> 00:17:22,916
Deary me. I think he passed out.

266
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,168
- Huh?
- Eh?

267
00:17:26,170 --> 00:17:27,421
Let's draw on his face!

268
00:17:28,047 --> 00:17:29,298
Hey, I wanna draw something.

269
00:17:29,381 --> 00:17:31,884
Heck, yeah. Me too.

270
00:17:34,845 --> 00:17:35,804
TENDO DOJO

271
00:17:35,888 --> 00:17:37,723
I mean, really,
you're so immature.

272
00:17:37,806 --> 00:17:40,851
Was it necessary to hit him
more than 500 times to beat him?

273
00:17:40,934 --> 00:17:42,227
I don't wanna hear it.

274
00:17:42,311 --> 00:17:43,937
He deserved a heck of a lot
worse than that

275
00:17:44,021 --> 00:17:46,106
after he went and slobbered
all over my face.

276
00:17:46,774 --> 00:17:48,942
Is it just me
or are you kinda acting fussy?

277
00:17:49,526 --> 00:17:51,278
So, what exactly did he do to you?

278
00:17:52,988 --> 00:17:54,531
Nothing. He did nothing.

279
00:17:55,407 --> 00:17:57,618
You were looking real lame
out there, Ranma.

280
00:17:58,118 --> 00:17:59,286
Oh, Ryoga.

281
00:17:59,369 --> 00:18:02,623
I never would've gotten myself
into a situation like that to begin with.

282
00:18:02,706 --> 00:18:05,417
Yeah, well, if I hadn't been wearing those
skates, it would've been a lot easier--

283
00:18:05,501 --> 00:18:07,669
You think you could've
somehow avoided the kiss?

284
00:18:08,837 --> 00:18:12,591
Ah, got it. So someone tried
to kiss Ranma earlier today?

285
00:18:12,674 --> 00:18:14,593
Who were you macking on?

286
00:18:14,676 --> 00:18:17,096
Well, I guess the one positive thing
you can take from this

287
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:18,972
is that it came from a very sexy man.

288
00:18:19,056 --> 00:18:20,766
It was a man?

289
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:25,354
There's no reason
for you to be ashamed about that.

290
00:18:25,437 --> 00:18:28,732
I guess it'd be a little tragic
if it was a first kiss or something.

291
00:18:28,816 --> 00:18:31,860
Oh, no, I'm sure there's no way
that could be the case, right, Ranma?

292
00:18:43,163 --> 00:18:46,792
Damn it. Why does everybody think
it's okay to make fun of me?

293
00:18:47,835 --> 00:18:49,336
No one understands how I feel.

294
00:18:50,796 --> 00:18:52,965
Your back is wide open.
Why's your guard down?

295
00:18:53,549 --> 00:18:55,008
You're not still sulking, are you?

296
00:18:56,468 --> 00:18:59,388
Just laugh at me
if you think it's so funny.

297
00:19:01,849 --> 00:19:03,350
Oh, come on, it's not that funny.

298
00:19:05,144 --> 00:19:07,563
Wait. That wasn't
actually your first kiss, was it?

299
00:19:07,646 --> 00:19:08,814
Hmm?

300
00:19:08,897 --> 00:19:11,775
No, and it's
none of your business.

301
00:19:11,859 --> 00:19:14,278
You're right.
I'll stop being so nosy then.

302
00:19:17,531 --> 00:19:19,283
You know what I was thinking though?

303
00:19:19,366 --> 00:19:20,242
Ow.

304
00:19:20,325 --> 00:19:21,660
You probably haven't trained hard enough

305
00:19:21,743 --> 00:19:24,663
if that guy was able to plant
a big, old smooch on you like that.

306
00:19:25,497 --> 00:19:27,332
You're always going around
talking a big game,

307
00:19:27,916 --> 00:19:29,918
but then you tend to let your guard down.

308
00:19:32,462 --> 00:19:34,131
Looks like you've got no room to talk.

309
00:19:34,798 --> 00:19:36,175
Uh...

310
00:19:37,801 --> 00:19:39,094
Uh...

311
00:19:44,266 --> 00:19:46,685
Uh, wait,
don't get the wrong idea.

312
00:19:46,768 --> 00:19:49,479
I wasn't going to swoop in
and kiss you like that guy or anything.

313
00:19:49,563 --> 00:19:51,106
Yeah, okay. I know that.

314
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:53,400
You don't have the guts
to do something like that anyway.

315
00:19:53,483 --> 00:19:56,153
Well, if you keep talking
like that, I'm gonna do it!

316
00:19:56,236 --> 00:19:58,655
I'd be very interested
to see if you actually can.

317
00:20:02,242 --> 00:20:03,702
Fine. Here I go.

318
00:20:04,494 --> 00:20:06,163
But you gotta close your eyes.

319
00:20:14,379 --> 00:20:15,464
Hmm? Hmm.

320
00:20:18,884 --> 00:20:20,552
Hmm.

321
00:20:34,441 --> 00:20:35,692
I mean, uh, I don't know...

322
00:20:35,776 --> 00:20:36,985
Should we do this?

323
00:20:37,069 --> 00:20:38,403
I-Is it a good idea?

324
00:20:43,659 --> 00:20:45,827
It'd be better to do this
with someone you like.

325
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:47,829
Wouldn't it?

326
00:20:50,165 --> 00:20:52,960
Oh, yeah.
I must not be good enough for you.

327
00:20:53,043 --> 00:20:55,170
- You know that's not what I was saying!
- Hmm?

328
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:04,012
'Cause I... I don't wanna do it
if it's a big deal.

329
00:21:04,554 --> 00:21:05,389
You know?

330
00:21:05,973 --> 00:21:07,391
Uh-huh.

331
00:21:09,851 --> 00:21:11,270
Hmm?

332
00:21:12,187 --> 00:21:14,481
Hurry up and decide
if you're gonna do this already.

333
00:21:14,564 --> 00:21:16,400
Some of us have stuff to get done!

334
00:21:16,483 --> 00:21:18,235
They're late bloomers.

335
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:26,994
Damn you, Ranma Saotome.

336
00:21:27,828 --> 00:21:31,415
The day we face off will be
the last one you ever live through!
